1
00:00:02,438 --> 00:00:04,523
Water.

2
00:00:04,649 --> 00:00:06,316
Earth.

3
00:00:06,401 --> 00:00:08,735
Fire.

4
00:00:08,903 --> 00:00:10,612
Air.

5
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:14,574
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:18,912
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,664 --> 00:00:23,709
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:23,793 --> 00:00:25,752
But when the world needed him most...

9
00:00:25,878 --> 00:00:27,212
He vanished.

10
00:00:27,422 --> 00:00:30,924
100 years passed, and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar,

11
00:00:31,009 --> 00:00:32,843
an airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:35,095
And although his
airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:37,806
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,932 --> 00:00:39,057
Oof!

15
00:00:39,142 --> 00:00:42,019
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:51,029 --> 00:00:54,364
Please, father, I only had
the Fire Nation's best interests at heart.

17
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:57,326
You will learn respect.

18
00:00:57,493 --> 00:01:00,704
And suffering will be your teacher.

19
00:01:01,164 --> 00:01:03,874
We no longer have anything
to gain by traveling together.

20
00:01:03,958 --> 00:01:05,917
I need to find my own way.

21
00:01:06,461 --> 00:01:07,711
You're like my sister.

22
00:01:07,795 --> 00:01:10,005
My father says she was born lucky.

23
00:01:10,214 --> 00:01:12,215
He says I was lucky to be born.

24
00:01:12,342 --> 00:01:14,009
I don't need luck, though.

25
00:01:14,135 --> 00:01:17,220
I've always had to struggle and fight,
and that's made me strong.

26
00:01:17,305 --> 00:01:18,680
It's made me who I am.

27
00:02:47,687 --> 00:02:50,188
Come on, spider-snake eyes.

28
00:02:53,151 --> 00:02:54,609
Yeah!

29
00:03:11,043 --> 00:03:14,045
Could I get some water,
a bag of feed, and something hot to eat?

30
00:03:14,297 --> 00:03:16,506
Not enough here for a hot meal.

31
00:03:17,133 --> 00:03:19,259
I can get you two bags of feed.

32
00:03:33,941 --> 00:03:35,025
Hey!

33
00:03:35,234 --> 00:03:37,194
You throwing eggs at us, stranger?

34
00:03:37,528 --> 00:03:38,528
No.

35
00:03:38,654 --> 00:03:40,071
You see who did throw it?

36
00:03:40,198 --> 00:03:41,364
No.

37
00:03:43,034 --> 00:03:45,243
That your favorite word, "No"?

38
00:03:45,369 --> 00:03:47,537
It had to come from somewhere.

39
00:03:47,663 --> 00:03:49,122
Maybe a chicken flew over.

40
00:03:52,668 --> 00:03:54,711
Thanks for your contribution.

41
00:03:54,921 --> 00:03:57,172
The army appreciates your support.

42
00:03:57,298 --> 00:03:59,132
You better leave town.

43
00:03:59,467 --> 00:04:03,094
Penalty for staying's a lot steeper than
you can afford, stranger.

44
00:04:03,387 --> 00:04:04,888
Trust me.

45
00:04:06,349 --> 00:04:09,976
Those soldiers are supposed
to protect us from the Fire Nation.

46
00:04:10,061 --> 00:04:12,771
But they're just a bunch of thugs.

47
00:04:14,941 --> 00:04:17,192
Thanks for not ratting me out.

48
00:04:21,447 --> 00:04:24,407
I'll take you to my house
and feed your ostrich horse for you.

49
00:04:24,492 --> 00:04:25,909
Come on, I owe you.

50
00:04:39,507 --> 00:04:41,299
No one can ever sneak up on us.

51
00:04:41,425 --> 00:04:43,051
No kidding.

52
00:04:49,016 --> 00:04:50,600
You a friend of Lee's?

53
00:04:52,478 --> 00:04:54,354
This guy just stood up to the soldiers.

54
00:04:54,438 --> 00:04:57,232
By the end, he practically
had them running away.

55
00:04:58,025 --> 00:04:59,317
Does this guy have a name?

56
00:04:59,402 --> 00:05:01,319
I'm...

57
00:05:01,696 --> 00:05:04,823
He doesn't have to
say who he is if he doesn't want to, Sela.

58
00:05:04,907 --> 00:05:09,327
Anyone who can hold his own against
those bully soldiers is welcome here.

59
00:05:09,829 --> 00:05:12,956
Those men should be ashamed
to wear Earth Kingdom uniforms.

60
00:05:13,332 --> 00:05:15,417
The real soldiers
are off fighting the war.

61
00:05:15,793 --> 00:05:17,502
Like Lee's big brother, Sensu.

62
00:05:18,170 --> 00:05:21,298
Supper's going to be ready soon.
Would you like to stay?

63
00:05:21,549 --> 00:05:22,674
I can't...

64
00:05:23,092 --> 00:05:24,342
I should be moving on.

65
00:05:25,928 --> 00:05:27,971
Gansu could use some help on the barn.

66
00:05:28,097 --> 00:05:31,391
Why don't you two work for a while,
and then we'll eat?

67
00:05:39,734 --> 00:05:41,901
You don't seem like
you're from around here.

68
00:05:43,446 --> 00:05:44,696
Where are you from, then?

69
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,780
Far away.

70
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,491
Where are you going?

71
00:05:48,618 --> 00:05:50,243
Lee, give it a rest.

72
00:05:50,328 --> 00:05:53,246
Stop asking the man personal questions,
got it?

73
00:05:53,497 --> 00:05:56,458
Yes.

74
00:05:57,209 --> 00:06:00,503
So how'd you get that scar?

75
00:06:00,796 --> 00:06:04,674
It's not nice to bother people about
things they might not want to talk about.

76
00:06:05,009 --> 00:06:07,552
The man's past is his business.

77
00:06:26,238 --> 00:06:29,240
Hey, mom, want to see how Azula
feeds turtle ducks?

78
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:32,869
Zuko, why would you do that?

79
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:48,760
Stupid turtle duck.

80
00:06:48,928 --> 00:06:50,553
Why'd she do that?

81
00:06:51,263 --> 00:06:54,099
Zuko, that's what moms are like.

82
00:06:54,225 --> 00:06:57,352
If you mess with their babies, hrum!

83
00:06:57,478 --> 00:06:58,937
They're gonna bite you back.

84
00:07:09,615 --> 00:07:11,950
Azula!

85
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:21,126
Watch this.

86
00:07:21,252 --> 00:07:23,712
Mom, can you make Zuko play with us?

87
00:07:23,838 --> 00:07:26,089
We need equal teams to play a game.

88
00:07:26,173 --> 00:07:28,133
I am not cartwheeling.

89
00:07:28,342 --> 00:07:31,553
You won't have to, cartwheeling's
not a game, dumb-dumb.

90
00:07:32,263 --> 00:07:34,723
I don't care,
I don't want to play with you.

91
00:07:34,974 --> 00:07:36,975
We are brother and sister.

92
00:07:37,101 --> 00:07:39,811
It's important for us
to spend time together.

93
00:07:39,895 --> 00:07:41,396
Don't you think so, mom?

94
00:07:42,356 --> 00:07:45,775
Yes, darling, I think it's a good idea
to play with your sister.

95
00:07:45,901 --> 00:07:48,528
Go on, now, just for a little while.

96
00:07:49,655 --> 00:07:51,281
Here's the way it goes.

97
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:55,493
Now what you do is try to knock the apple
off the other person's head, like this.

98
00:08:04,378 --> 00:08:07,881
See, I told you it would work.

99
00:08:08,215 --> 00:08:10,800
Aw, they're so cute together.

100
00:08:11,051 --> 00:08:13,428
You two are such...

101
00:08:14,138 --> 00:08:15,597
I was just coming to get you.

102
00:08:15,681 --> 00:08:17,932
Uncle Iroh sent us a letter
from the war front.

103
00:08:18,058 --> 00:08:19,559
You're soaking wet.

104
00:08:19,685 --> 00:08:21,853
Girls are crazy!

105
00:08:23,981 --> 00:08:27,025
If the city is as
magnificent as its wall,

106
00:08:27,151 --> 00:08:30,195
Ba Sing Se must be something to behold.

107
00:08:30,905 --> 00:08:33,865
I hope you all may see it some day.

108
00:08:33,949 --> 00:08:36,075
If we don't burn it to the ground, first.

109
00:08:40,122 --> 00:08:42,457
"Until then, enjoy these gifts.

110
00:08:43,918 --> 00:08:46,252
"For Zuko, a pearl dagger,

111
00:08:46,378 --> 00:08:50,048
"from the general who surrendered
when we broke through the outer wall.

112
00:08:50,174 --> 00:08:54,093
"Note the inscription and
the superior craftsmanship."

113
00:08:54,553 --> 00:08:56,137
"Never give up without a fight."

114
00:08:56,305 --> 00:08:58,056
"And for Azula.

115
00:08:58,182 --> 00:09:00,099
"A new friend.

116
00:09:00,226 --> 00:09:04,145
"She wears the latest fashion
for Earth Kingdom girls."

117
00:09:04,271 --> 00:09:06,689
If uncle doesn't make it back from war

118
00:09:06,774 --> 00:09:09,692
Then dad would be next in line
to be Fire Lord, wouldn't he?

119
00:09:09,777 --> 00:09:11,611
Azula, we don't speak that way.

120
00:09:11,695 --> 00:09:14,489
It would be awful if Uncle Iroh
didn't return.

121
00:09:14,657 --> 00:09:18,284
And besides, Fire Lord Azulon is
a picture of health.

122
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:21,704
How would you like it if cousin Lu Ten
wanted dad to die?

123
00:09:21,831 --> 00:09:23,623
I still think our dad would make

124
00:09:23,707 --> 00:09:27,877
a much better Fire Lord than
his royal tea-loving kookiness.

125
00:10:01,453 --> 00:10:03,746
You're holding them all wrong.

126
00:10:09,295 --> 00:10:11,754
Keep in mind, these are dual swords.

127
00:10:12,089 --> 00:10:14,090
Two halves of a single weapon.

128
00:10:15,384 --> 00:10:17,886
Don't think of them as separate,
because they're not.

129
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:20,763
They're just two different parts
of the same whole.

130
00:10:34,278 --> 00:10:37,030
I think you'd really like
my brother, Sensu.

131
00:10:37,114 --> 00:10:39,616
He used to show me stuff
like this all the time.

132
00:10:44,872 --> 00:10:47,707
Here, this ought to
get you through a few meals.

133
00:10:54,465 --> 00:10:55,840
What do you think they want?

134
00:10:56,592 --> 00:10:57,759
Trouble.

135
00:11:08,812 --> 00:11:10,480
What do you want, Gow?

136
00:11:10,773 --> 00:11:15,526
Just thought someone ought to tell you
your son's battalion got captured.

137
00:11:16,153 --> 00:11:18,154
You boys hear what the Fire Nation did

138
00:11:18,238 --> 00:11:20,698
with their last group
of Earth Kingdom prisoners?

139
00:11:21,033 --> 00:11:23,326
Dressed 'em up in Fire Nation uniforms

140
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:26,663
and put them on the front line
unarmed, way I heard it.

141
00:11:28,123 --> 00:11:29,958
Then they just watched.

142
00:11:30,042 --> 00:11:31,167
You watch your mouth.

143
00:11:39,218 --> 00:11:42,720
Why bother rooting around
in the mud with these pigs?

144
00:11:55,693 --> 00:11:57,860
Iroh has lost his son.

145
00:11:57,945 --> 00:12:00,863
Your cousin, Lu Ten,
did not survive the battle.

146
00:12:03,826 --> 00:12:06,160
What's gonna happen to my brother?

147
00:12:06,412 --> 00:12:07,870
I'm going to the front.

148
00:12:08,372 --> 00:12:10,581
I'm going to find Sensu
and bring him back.

149
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:17,797
When my dad goes

150
00:12:18,132 --> 00:12:19,799
will you stay?

151
00:12:20,217 --> 00:12:22,135
No. I need to move on.

152
00:12:23,512 --> 00:12:25,430
Here, I want you to have this.

153
00:12:25,723 --> 00:12:26,973
Read the inscription.

154
00:12:27,182 --> 00:12:29,058
"Made in Earth Kingdom."

155
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,601
The other one.

156
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:33,813
"Never give up without a fight."

157
00:12:47,286 --> 00:12:50,455
You waste all your time playing
with knives, you're not even good.

158
00:12:50,914 --> 00:12:53,791
Put an apple on your head and
we'll find out how good I am.

159
00:12:54,043 --> 00:12:56,252
By the way, uncle's coming home.

160
00:12:56,587 --> 00:12:59,172
Does that mean we won the war?

161
00:12:59,465 --> 00:13:02,633
No, it means uncle's
a quitter and a loser.

162
00:13:02,718 --> 00:13:04,093
What are you talking about?

163
00:13:04,178 --> 00:13:05,303
Uncle's not a quitter.

164
00:13:05,387 --> 00:13:06,846
Yes he is.

165
00:13:07,139 --> 00:13:09,599
He found out his son died
and he just fell apart.

166
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:13,269
A real general would stay and
burn Ba Sing Se to the ground.

167
00:13:13,353 --> 00:13:15,980
Not lose the battle and come home crying.

168
00:13:16,190 --> 00:13:17,857
How do you know what he should do?

169
00:13:18,108 --> 00:13:21,027
He's probably just sad
his only kid is gone.

170
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,695
Forever.

171
00:13:23,155 --> 00:13:26,032
Your father has requested
an audience with Fire Lord Azulon.

172
00:13:26,116 --> 00:13:27,241
Best clothes, hurry up.

173
00:13:27,409 --> 00:13:30,912
"Fire Lord Azulon."
Can't you just call him grandfather?

174
00:13:30,996 --> 00:13:33,581
He's not exactly the powerful
Fire Lord he used to be.

175
00:13:34,083 --> 00:13:36,542
Someone will probably end up
taking his place, soon.

176
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:37,835
Young lady!

177
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,587
Not another word.

178
00:13:41,465 --> 00:13:43,091
What is wrong with that child?

179
00:13:43,967 --> 00:13:46,511
And how was it
great-grandfather Sozin

180
00:13:46,595 --> 00:13:49,472
managed to win the battle of Han Tui?

181
00:13:49,973 --> 00:13:53,476
Great-grandfather won... Because...

182
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:55,645
Because even though
his army was outnumbered

183
00:13:55,729 --> 00:13:57,563
he cleverly calculated his advantages.

184
00:13:57,648 --> 00:13:59,899
The enemy was downwind,
and there was a drought.

185
00:13:59,983 --> 00:14:02,527
Their defenses burned to a crisp
in minutes.

186
00:14:02,736 --> 00:14:04,403
Correct, my dear.

187
00:14:04,571 --> 00:14:09,117
Now, would you show grandfather
the new moves you demonstrated to me?

188
00:14:33,809 --> 00:14:35,977
She's a true prodigy.

189
00:14:36,603 --> 00:14:40,106
Just like her grandfather
for whom she's named.

190
00:14:41,191 --> 00:14:43,234
You'll never catch up.

191
00:14:43,527 --> 00:14:45,903
I'd like to demonstrate
what I've been learning.

192
00:15:08,594 --> 00:15:10,178
I failed...

193
00:15:10,262 --> 00:15:12,680
No, I loved watching you.

194
00:15:12,764 --> 00:15:16,601
That's who you are, Zuko, someone who
keeps fighting even though it's hard.

195
00:15:16,977 --> 00:15:21,022
Prince Ozai, why are you
wasting my time with this pomp?

196
00:15:21,481 --> 00:15:24,150
Just tell me what you want.
Everyone else, go.

197
00:15:28,488 --> 00:15:29,947
-What are you...
-Shh!

198
00:15:30,908 --> 00:15:35,244
Father. You must have realized,
as I have,

199
00:15:35,329 --> 00:15:40,166
that with Lu Ten gone,
Iroh's bloodline has ended.

200
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:45,421
After his son's death, my brother
abandoned the siege at Ba Sing Se.

201
00:15:45,756 --> 00:15:47,882
And who knows when he will return home?

202
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:52,803
But I am here, Father.
And my children are alive.

203
00:15:53,305 --> 00:15:54,889
Say what it is you want.

204
00:15:55,015 --> 00:15:58,601
Father, revoke Iroh's birthright.

205
00:15:58,936 --> 00:16:02,647
I am your humble servant,
here to serve you and our nation.

206
00:16:03,106 --> 00:16:04,398
Use me.

207
00:16:04,524 --> 00:16:08,861
You dare suggest I betray Iroh?

208
00:16:09,154 --> 00:16:11,239
My firstborn?

209
00:16:11,323 --> 00:16:14,659
Directly after the demise
of his only beloved son?

210
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:18,287
I think Iroh has suffered enough.

211
00:16:18,372 --> 00:16:19,580
But you?

212
00:16:19,665 --> 00:16:22,792
Your punishment has scarcely begun!

213
00:16:31,009 --> 00:16:33,261
♪ Dad's going to kill you ♪

214
00:16:33,387 --> 00:16:35,096
Really, he is.

215
00:16:35,389 --> 00:16:37,890
Ha, ha, Azula, nice try.

216
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:39,558
Fine, don't believe me.

217
00:16:39,851 --> 00:16:41,102
But I heard everything.

218
00:16:41,186 --> 00:16:43,980
Grandfather said dad's
punishment should fit his crime.

219
00:16:44,147 --> 00:16:47,608
"You must know the pain
of losing a firstborn son.

220
00:16:47,693 --> 00:16:49,527
"By sacrificing your own."

221
00:16:49,903 --> 00:16:50,987
Liar.

222
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:53,698
I'm only telling you for your own good.

223
00:16:53,824 --> 00:16:57,994
I know! Maybe you could find a nice
Earth Kingdom family to adopt you.

224
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:02,039
Stop it, you're lying.
Dad would never do that to me.

225
00:17:02,124 --> 00:17:04,333
Your father would never
do what to you?

226
00:17:04,418 --> 00:17:06,085
What is going on here?

227
00:17:06,211 --> 00:17:07,461
I don't know.

228
00:17:07,629 --> 00:17:08,963
It's time for a talk.

229
00:17:12,342 --> 00:17:16,220
Azula always lies, Azula always lies.

230
00:17:16,305 --> 00:17:17,972
Azula always lies.

231
00:17:21,893 --> 00:17:22,977
You have to help.

232
00:17:23,061 --> 00:17:25,980
It's Lee, the thugs from town
came back as soon as Gansu left.

233
00:17:26,106 --> 00:17:29,275
When they ordered us to give them food,
Lee pulled a knife on them.

234
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:31,235
I don't even know
where he got a knife.

235
00:17:31,653 --> 00:17:34,864
Then they took him away.
They told me if Lee's old enough to fight,

236
00:17:35,198 --> 00:17:37,199
he's old enough to join the army.

237
00:17:37,284 --> 00:17:39,160
I know we barely know you, but...

238
00:17:40,829 --> 00:17:42,621
I'll get your son back.

239
00:17:51,006 --> 00:17:52,548
Hey, there he is!

240
00:17:53,008 --> 00:17:54,383
I told you he'd come.

241
00:18:09,358 --> 00:18:10,775
Let the kid go.

242
00:18:14,071 --> 00:18:16,864
Who do you think you are?
Telling us what to do?

243
00:18:17,574 --> 00:18:19,325
It doesn't matter who I am.

244
00:18:19,409 --> 00:18:20,618
But I know who you are.

245
00:18:20,952 --> 00:18:22,161
You're not soldiers.

246
00:18:22,496 --> 00:18:23,954
You're bullies.

247
00:18:24,039 --> 00:18:25,998
Freeloaders abusing your power.

248
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:28,667
Mostly over women and kids.

249
00:18:29,252 --> 00:18:30,878
You don't want Lee in your army.

250
00:18:30,962 --> 00:18:34,799
You're sick cowards messing with a family
who's already lost one son to the war.

251
00:18:36,468 --> 00:18:40,096
Are you gonna let this stranger
stand there and insult you like this?

252
00:19:32,691 --> 00:19:34,275
Give him a left!

253
00:19:34,359 --> 00:19:35,609
A left!

254
00:19:35,694 --> 00:19:37,111
It's not a fistfight.

255
00:19:37,195 --> 00:19:39,405
He's got a left sword, don't he?

256
00:19:46,746 --> 00:19:48,831
-Look out!
-Behind you!

257
00:20:10,562 --> 00:20:11,562
Mom?

258
00:20:11,730 --> 00:20:14,648
Zuko, please, my love, listen to me.

259
00:20:14,816 --> 00:20:17,568
Everything I've done,
I've done to protect you.

260
00:20:20,363 --> 00:20:21,614
Remember this, Zuko.

261
00:20:22,032 --> 00:20:27,495
No matter how things may seem to change,
never forget who you are.

262
00:20:37,631 --> 00:20:38,756
Get up.

263
00:21:02,739 --> 00:21:05,491
Who... Who are you?

264
00:21:05,951 --> 00:21:07,660
My name is Zuko.

265
00:21:07,911 --> 00:21:10,829
Son of Ursa and Fire Lord Ozai.

266
00:21:11,498 --> 00:21:14,583
Prince of the Fire Nation
and heir to the throne!

267
00:21:15,168 --> 00:21:16,752
Fire Nation...

268
00:21:18,421 --> 00:21:19,421
Liar!

269
00:21:19,506 --> 00:21:22,758
I heard of you, you're not a prince,
you're an outcast.

270
00:21:23,134 --> 00:21:25,928
His own father burned and disowned him.

271
00:21:33,395 --> 00:21:35,437
Not a step closer.

272
00:21:36,773 --> 00:21:38,816
It's yours, you should have it.

273
00:21:39,276 --> 00:21:41,193
No, I hate you.

274
00:21:44,864 --> 00:21:46,323
Mom?

275
00:21:47,075 --> 00:21:49,326
Mom, mom!

276
00:21:56,501 --> 00:21:58,961
-Where's mom?
-No one knows.

277
00:21:59,087 --> 00:22:01,964
And last night, grandpa passed away.

278
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:04,967
Not funny, Azula. You're sick.

279
00:22:05,135 --> 00:22:07,136
And I want my knife back, now.

280
00:22:07,220 --> 00:22:09,430
Who's going to make me?

281
00:22:09,639 --> 00:22:10,723
Mom?

282
00:22:16,021 --> 00:22:17,229
Where is she?

283
00:22:24,654 --> 00:22:30,451
Azulon, Fire Lord
to our nation for 23 years,

284
00:22:30,535 --> 00:22:34,371
you were our fearless leader
in the battle of Garsai.

285
00:22:34,789 --> 00:22:38,709
Our matchless conqueror
of the Hu Xin provinces.

286
00:22:39,169 --> 00:22:40,961
You were father of Iroh.

287
00:22:41,963 --> 00:22:43,797
Father of Ozai.

288
00:22:44,341 --> 00:22:47,760
Husband of Ilah, now passed.

289
00:22:47,969 --> 00:22:51,221
Grandfather of Lu Ten, now passed.

290
00:22:51,806 --> 00:22:54,767
Grandfather of Zuko and Azula.

291
00:22:59,314 --> 00:23:01,231
We lay you to rest.

292
00:23:01,316 --> 00:23:02,816
As was your dying wish,

293
00:23:02,901 --> 00:23:07,780
you are now succeeded by your second son.

294
00:23:12,202 --> 00:23:15,204
Hail Fire Lord Ozai!
